    "critical_safety_finding": "The maximum softmax probability (MSP) guard is severely deficient on out-of-distribution inputs. Models exhibit extreme semantic overconfidence when fed non-domain photographs (CIFAR-10). For example, Pediatric Chest X-Ray fails to reject 100% of photographic images at the standard 0.50 threshold (0.0% rejection rate; 100% false accept rate), predicting normal/pneumonia with mean confidence 97.9%. The platform CANNOT claim to reject real-world photographs or low-quality camera photos."
  },
